==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Magikarp|32}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*'''Waterfall Evolution''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Rapid Evolution''' on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Magikarp|47}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

